BEGIN 

CREATE required output folders 

  

PARSE the command entered by the user 

  

IF the command is VALIDATE THEN 

    CHECK all required environment variables 

    IF all required values are present THEN 

        DISPLAY a message that the environment is valid 

    ELSE 

        DISPLAY a list of missing values 

        STOP the program 

    ENDIF

ENDIF 

  

IF the command is SERVE THEN 

    START the webhook server 

    START the Ngrok tunnel 

    KEEP the server running until the user stops it 

ENDIF 

  

IF the command is CALL THEN 

    CHECK Twilio configuration 

    CREATE an outbound call 

    WAIT until the call has ended 

    WAIT until the recording has been saved 

ENDIF 

  

IF the command is RUN THEN 

    CHECK Twilio configuration 

    START the webhook server and tunnel 

    CREATE an outbound call 

    WAIT until the call has ended 

    WAIT until the recording has been saved 

ENDIF 

  

IF the command is UNKNOWN THEN 

    DISPLAY an error message 

    STOP the program 

ENDIF 

 

END 

 

WHEN a voice call is received: 

 

RECEIVE the user input from Twilio 

FIND the conversation for this call ID 

IF no conversation exists THEN 

    CREATE a new conversation 

ENDIF 

  

IF the user input is empty or contains a blocked phrase THEN 

    RETURN an empty response 

ELSE 

    SEND the user input to the conversation manager 

    ASK the AI model for the next response 

    EXTRACT the spoken reply and determine whether the call should end 

    SAVE the transcript 

    SAVE the bug report 

    RETURN the spoken response to Twilio 

ENDIF 

 

END 

 

WHEN a call status update is received: 

 

STORE the latest call status in the conversation data 

SAVE the transcript 

SAVE the bug report 

 

END 

 

WHEN a recording status update is received: 

 

SAVE recording information 

IF the recording is complete THEN 

    DOWNLOAD the audio file 

    SAVE the audio file 

ENDIF 

SIGNAL that the recording process has finished 

 

END 

 

WHEN a simulation scenario is run: 

SELECT a scenario 

CREATE a conversation based on the scenario instructions 

REPEAT until all scenario messages have been processed 

    GET the next patient message 

    SEND the message to the AI model 

    STORE the assistant response 

ENDREPEAT 

SAVE the transcript 

SAVE the bug report 

 

END 

 